  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十一关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_r"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是最后一批追击我们的整合运动了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呃啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "确保！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "确认安全无虞！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敌方的指挥官呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——不在这批敌人里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一直潜伏着......观察着，尾随着我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是想消磨我们的体力，等到稳操胜券后，再发动袭击吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整合运动的敌人非常擅长发动偷袭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这点，我们在切尔诺伯格时就领教过了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "暂时撤退——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没法确保撤退路线的安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果他们破坏建筑物来封锁路口，我们就危险了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——立刻侦查其他的路线！越隐蔽越好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米娅，四点钟方向，那个向下方街道移动的阶梯如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那里可不好走哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊！罗德岛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是伏击！小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "继续给我追。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别让他们有任何喘息的机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......长官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——贫民区......里有一些被感染的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果可以的话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望你能......照看他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "保护龙门是近卫局的责任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感染者，并非是龙门公民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但龙门的感染者依然属于龙门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没任何理由向你保证，但我会尽到我的职责。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毕竟——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们说过，以前也——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "="
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是我们一直在做的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——你知道我们找你的原因吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想不出自己有什么值得你们追缉的理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我觉得，也许......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原因不在我，却在——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我的父亲身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "————是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的父亲，是切尔诺伯格最著名的科学家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "同时，他也是切尔诺伯格重要的政治人物之一。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许，你身上有着......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我们不能允许你落入整合运动之手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵，找到你们了，龙门近卫局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然我和你们无冤无仇——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我手上有一个很有意思的剧本哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为了让事情变得好玩起来，有必要让你们参与其中呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就让我们开始吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
